  "statement": "Without using a calculator, determine which is larger: $2^{100}$ or $3^{63}$. Justify your answer.",
  "solution": "Since $2^{10}=1024>729=3^{6}$, raising both sides to the power $10$ gives $2^{100}>3^{60}$. Now $3^{63}=3^{3}\\\\cdot3^{60}=27\\\\cdot3^{60}$. We need to compare $2^{100}$ with $27\\\\cdot3^{60}$. Write $2^{100}=2^{100}\\\\cdot\\\\tfrac{3^{60}}{3^{60}}$; equivalently compare $\\\\dfrac{2^{100}}{3^{60}}$ with $27$. Now $\\\\dfrac{2^{100}}{3^{60}}=\\\\left(\\\\dfrac{2^{10}}{3^{6}}\\\\right)^{10}=\\\\left(\\\\dfrac{1024}{729}\\\\right)^{10}$. Since $\\\\dfrac{1024}{729}>1.4$ and $1.4^{10}>28>27$, we have $\\\\dfrac{2^{100}}{3^{60}}>27$, so $2^{100}>27\\\\cdot3^{60}=3^{63}$. Therefore $2^{100}>3^{63}$.",
